Z||000000||fropuff||11-06-2001||06:58 PM||||Hey guys.  Well, I got word from the courthouse today, and they said that I won my case!  So, that's 1 for me; 0 for the lying corksooker.  AND, it's $2783.10 for me; -$2783.10 for him.  I'm a little excited, to say the least.  I've already got all the parts paid for, so I just need to find something to use it on.  I plan on paying a paint guy $1000 to paint it (I'll do all the prep), so I figure I have $1800 left.  $450 for Mr. Mikes.  $150 for tint.  $1200 left.  I'm thinking nitrous now.  I've always wanted it, so now's a good time.  The rest goes in the bank for FULL COVERAGE insurance.  If I had it, the car would have been fixed by now.  Oh well.  Sorry for being so damn happy.  I'll go back to my normal self soon.  ||||reg||10
Z||000001||Mach10||11-06-2001||07:02 PM||||Uh.... What's the settlement for, or did you just pick someone randomly to sue?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> ||||reg||10
